 191      3E3C2F61 
 192 01c3 35303022 		.ascii	"500\">\011  \015\012\011  <h1>lwIP - A Lightweight "
 192      3E092020 
 192      0D0A0920 
 192      203C6831 
 192      3E6C7749 
 193 01e9 5443502F 		.ascii	"TCP/IP Stack</h1>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    T"
 193      49502053 
 193      7461636B 
 193      3C2F6831 
 193      3E0D0A09 
 194 020a 68652077 		.ascii	"he web page you are watching was served by a simple"
 194      65622070 
 194      61676520 
 194      796F7520 
 194      61726520 
 195 023d 20776562 		.ascii	" web\015\012\011    server running on top of the li"
 195      0D0A0920 
 195      20202073 
 195      65727665 
 195      72207275 
 196 0267 67687477 		.ascii	"ghtweight TCP/IP stack <a\015\012\011    href=\"htt"
 196      65696768 
 196      74205443 
 196      502F4950 
 196      20737461 
 197 0290 703A2F2F 		.ascii	"p://www.sics.se/~adam/lwip/\">lwIP</a>.\015\012\011"
 197      7777772E 
 197      73696373 
 197      2E73652F 
 197      7E616461 
 198 02b9 20203C2F 		.ascii	"  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    lwIP is an o"
 198      703E0D0A 
 198      0920203C 
 198      703E0D0A 
 198      09202020 
 199 02da 70656E20 		.ascii	"pen source implementation of the TCP/IP\015\012\011"
 199      736F7572 
 199      63652069 
 199      6D706C65 
 199      6D656E74 
 200 0304 20202020 		.ascii	"    protocol suite that was originally written by <"
 200      70726F74 
 200      6F636F6C 
 200      20737569 
 200      74652074 
 201 0337 610D0A09 		.ascii	"a\015\012\011    href=\"http://www.sics.se/~adam/lw"
 201      20202020 
 201      68726566 
 201      3D226874 
 201      74703A2F 
 202 0360 69702F22 		.ascii	"ip/\">Adam Dunkels\015\012\011    of the Swedish In"
 202      3E416461 
 202      6D204475 
 202      6E6B656C 
 202      730D0A09 
 203 0389 73746974 		.ascii	"stitute of Computer Science</a> but now is\015\012\011"
 203      75746520 
 203      6F662043 
 203      6F6D7075 
 203      74657220 
 204 03b6 20202020 		.ascii	"    being actively developed by a team of developer"
 204      6265696E 
 204      67206163 
 204      74697665 
 204      6C792064 
 205 03e9 730D0A09 		.ascii	"s\015\012\011    distributed world-wide. Since it's"
 205      20202020 
 205      64697374 
 205      72696275 
 205      74656420 
 206 0413 2072656C 		.ascii	" release, lwIP has\015\012\011    spurred a lot of "
 206      65617365 
 206      2C206C77 
 206      49502068 
 206      61730D0A 
 207 043d 696E7465 		.ascii	"interest and has been ported to several\015\012\011"
 207      72657374 
 207      20616E64 
 207      20686173 
 207      20626565 
 208 0467 20202020 		.ascii	"    platforms and operating systems. lwIP can be us"
 208      706C6174 
 208      666F726D 
 208      7320616E 
 208      64206F70 
 209 049a 65642065 		.ascii	"ed either\015\012\011    with or without an underly"
 209      69746865 
 209      720D0A09 
 209      20202020 
 209      77697468 
 210 04c4 696E6720 		.ascii	"ing OS.\015\012\011  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011"
 210      4F532E0D 
 210      0A092020 
 210      3C2F703E 
 210      0D0A0920 
 211 04df 20202020 		.ascii	"    The focus of the lwIP TCP/IP implementation is "
 211      54686520 
 211      666F6375 
 211      73206F66 
 211      20746865 
 212 0512 746F2072 		.ascii	"to reduce\015\012\011    the RAM usage while still "
 212      65647563 
 212      650D0A09 
 212      20202020 
 212      74686520 
 213 053c 68617669 		.ascii	"having a full scale TCP. This\015\012\011    makes "
 213      6E672061 
 213      2066756C 
 213      6C207363 
 213      616C6520 
 214 0566 6C774950 		.ascii	"lwIP suitable for use in embedded systems with tens"
 214      20737569 
 214      7461626C 
 214      6520666F 
 214      72207573 
 215 0599 0D0A0920 		.ascii	"\015\012\011    of kilobytes of free RAM and room f"
 215      2020206F 
 215      66206B69 
 215      6C6F6279 
 215      74657320 
 216 05c3 6F722061 		.ascii	"or around 40 kilobytes\015\012\011    of code ROM.\015"
 216      726F756E 
 216      64203430 
 216      206B696C 
 216      6F627974 
 217 05ed 0A092020 		.ascii	"\012\011  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    More"
 217      3C2F703E 
 217      0D0A0920 
 217      203C703E 
 217      0D0A0920 
